ln - make a hard link

SYNOPSIS
    ln old new

DESCRIPTION
    Create a directory entry named new for the non-directory file old. Both
    names refer to the same inode and share data, ownership, and mode. The
    new pathname must be unused and on the same filesystem.

SEE ALSO
    ls(1), mv(1), rm(1), stat(1)
